            <h2>Donate to Cara and North Lawndale Works</h2>
            <p>Thank you for considering a gift to Cara and North Lawndale Works. 
            Your investment will help to prepare and inspire motivated North Lawndale residents to 
            break the cycles of homelessness and poverty, transform their lives, 
            strengthen our community, and forge paths to real and lasting success.</p>
                      
            <p>Every dollar makes a difference and every job begins a path to success. 
            So, thank you for considering a donation in support of our motivated job seekers and our mission!</p>
            
            
            <p>Cara values the privacy of our donors. Read our
                <apex:outputLink value="https://carachicago.org/app/uploads/Donor-Privacy-Policy-and-Donors-Bill-of-Rights.pdf" id="theLink1" target="_blank">
                 Donor Privacy Policy and Bill of Rights.
                </apex:outputLink>
            </p>
            <p>
                <i>Cara is recognized as exempt under section 501(c)(3) of the Internal Revenue Code. Donations are 100% tax-deductible.</i>
            </p>        
            
            
